<title>USA: Isco links Q2 decline to higher expenses.</title>
<headline>Isco links Q2 decline to higher expenses.</headline>
<dateline>LINCOLN, Neb. 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Isco Inc on Monday said a decline in its fiscal second-quarter earnings reflected higher operating expenses and a writeoff of accounts receivable.</p>
<p>The company, which makes equipment for water pollution monitoring and chemical separation, said its expenses in the quarter ended January 24 included $364,000 related to the acquisition of Suprex Corp</p>
